<h2>Fonts, variables and CSS</h2>

<ul>
  <li><c>vars</c> — CSS variables for the whole deck: <c>--font-text</c>, <c>--font-heading</c>, <c>--font-code</c>, <c>--text-size</c>, <c>--heading-size</c>, <c>--move-dur</c></li>
  <li><c>fonts</c> — local font files (path relative to the deck folder)</li>
  <li><c>googleFonts</c> — families loaded from Google Fonts</li>
  <li><c>css</c> — a stylesheet for anything else; combine with <c>class:</c> in the <c><slide></c> block</li>
</ul>

<p>
  Code is drawn in the monospace font <c>--font-code</c> (Iosevka by default); the layout measures it, so use monospace fonts.
</p>
